# No hanging browser tools

Do not use `cursor-ide-browser` (browser_navigate, browser_lock, browser_tabs, browser_snapshot, browser_cdp, or any other tool in that namespace). In this project it freezes for minutes waiting for a glass browser tab that never opens.

For UI checks:
- Trust the code change and ask the user to glance at localhost
- Use a quick `curl` against the running Next.js server if you only need to confirm the page responds
- Never retry a hung browser call, and never wait more than a few seconds on a tool that already timed out
